  "description": {
    "text": "The reward pack (奖赏包) is the one-card prize for the winner in the Happy Set Pikachu & Clefairy & Turtwig & Gimmighoul of 17 January 2025, and it went to the winner of each four-player Happy Battle (嗨皮大对决) event from 18 January 2025. It holds one of 14 holos: one of the eight basic Energy, in 87.5% of packs, or one of six Pokémon, in 12.5%: Tinkatink, Tinkatuff, Tinkaton, Pawniard, Bisharp and Kingambit. The six Pokémon are numbered out of 6.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Eternal Birth and the Happy Set: the Scarlet & Violet series begins (22 December 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15585.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Happy Battle events (16 January 2025)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/event/15569.html"
      }
    ]
  },
